---
kind: scene
id: south.museumRevive
title: Dr. Kell brings a fossil back
on: talk
target: npc.pebbletonKell
priority: 20
when: "run.southFossil != 'none'"
---

// The fossil the player carried out of the dig (run.southFossil) comes back
// to life; the engine raises caught@mon.<species> afterwards.

## The back room

::bg{location="museum-lab" time="day"}
::auto{character="pebbletonKell" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@pebbletonKell{emotion="surprised"}: Is that — from Moonstone? From the deep beds? Give it here. Gently. GENTLY.
@pebbletonKell: The machine is old, the theory is older, and I have done this exactly twice. Stand back. Further. Behind the lead screen, please.
::sfx{sound="revive-machine"}
::vfx{type="flash"}
<match on="run.southFossil">
  <when is="dome">
    @pebbletonKell{emotion="happy"}: It moved! It's a Domefossil! It's looking at you like you owe it seventy million years of rent.
    ::gift{species="domefossil" level="5"}
  </when>
  <when is="spiral">
    @pebbletonKell{emotion="happy"}: It moved! It's a Spiralfossil! Hello, little one. Hello. Don't bite the doctor.
    ::gift{species="spiralfossil" level="5"}
  </when>
</match>
@pebbletonKell: It's yours. It knows you better than me: you carried it out of the dark. Look after it.
